# Powers and Abilities 

## Bear Claws
You can use your paws as natural weapons. You are proficient with your unarmed strikes, which deal 1d4 slashing damage on a hit.

## Powerful Build
You count as one size larger when determining your carrying capacity and the weight you can push, drag, or lift.

## Natural Prowess
You gain advantage on any Perception check that benefits your powerful sense of smell. This perception bonus is not granted to any sense other than smell.
